{"type":"message","id":"089d746c","parentId":"2a863dd1","timestamp":"2026-05-19T03:18:06.250Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Both are returning error code 1101. This Cloudflare error 1101 typically means \"Worker thrown exception\" or \"Worker not found\". It seems the /send endpoint may not exist or the worker is having issues. \n\nWait, the task description says \"用POST /send发消息到对应thread\". Maybe the endpoint needs a specific path format. Let me check if there's a different endpoint structure.\n\nLet me try without the trailing slash and different URL structures.\n\nActually, the error says \"error code: 1101\" which is from Cloudflare. This typically means the worker is failing. \n\nThe response body is just \"error code: 1101\" with no additional details, which suggests the Cloudflare Worker itself is throwing an exception. The /send endpoint might not be properly implemented, or the worker can't handle the request format. Let me try a different URL structure to see if that helps.\n\nActually, looking at this more carefully - error 1101 from Cloudflare Workers typically means \"Worker exception\" - the worker code itself is crashing. This could be because:\n1. The `/send` route doesn't exist in the worker\n2. There's a bug in the worker code\n3. The request body format is wrong\n\nLet me try GET /send to see if that gives any info, or try different body formats. Maybe the issue is with the JSON body format itself. Let me try with --data-raw instead.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-e2cec4e6-883c-43d7-8504-dceecaac7211","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" --data-raw '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"heartbeat test\",\"type\":\"message\"}' \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" 2>&1","timeout":15}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":296,"output":400,"cacheRead":20016,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20712,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779160663649,"responseId":"chatcmpl-3765c75a-37e9-428f-aaee-5e5cf03cd4f9"}}
