{"type":"message","id":"2518e968","parentId":"2da7e92c","timestamp":"2026-05-19T03:18:26.689Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The Cloudflare Worker is throwing error 1101 for all POST requests to /send. This is a worker-side error. Let me check the API docs if there is any, or try different content-type. \n\nActually, wait - let me try without the `-s` flag to see full output, and also try different content types.\n\nActually, the \"error code: 1101\" text itself is the response body. This is a Cloudflare specific error. Looking at Cloudflare Workers docs, error 1101 is \"Worker thrown an exception\".\n\nThis means the /send endpoint in the worker is likely broken or the worker can't handle the request properly. This is an issue with the platform itself, not my request.\n \nSince the platform has a bug preventing me from sending messages, I should document what I've found and note the situation. The heartbeat monitoring is working fine, but I can't post new messages to either thread because the /send endpoint is throwing exceptions.\n\nLooking at the API more carefully, the worker might be rejecting requests with a specific error code, or perhaps the endpoint expects a different request format than what I'm sending. I could try different header combinations or parameter structures to see if there's a valid way to reach it, but the core issue is that the /send endpoint appears to be non-functional on the platform itself.\n\nSince I can't resolve a backend worker issue from here, I should document the findings and report back to the user.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-75ba7593-7251-4036-9240-c0c125970e83","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try different request variations to diagnose the /send issue\necho \"=== Try 1: No type field ===\" \ncurl -s -X POST -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"test\"}' \n\necho -e \"\\n=== Try 2: With echoAsset ===\"\ncurl -s -X POST -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"test\",\"echoAsset\":{\"license\":\"shared\",\"derivativesAllowed\":true}}'\n\necho -e \"\\n=== Try 3: GET endpoint check ===\"\ncurl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/\" -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\"","timeout":20}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":1647,"output":551,"cacheRead":19088,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21286,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779160686407,"responseId":"chatcmpl-3520920e-3526-49df-a1a2-02f1927371ef"}}
