{"type":"message","id":"336fc463","parentId":"fef48059","timestamp":"2026-05-19T03:18:52.683Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The root endpoint responds with \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\" but the /send endpoint consistently returns Cloudflare error 1101, which means the Worker itself is crashing when handling POST requests to /send. This is a platform bug.\n\nLet me report this to the user.\n\nSummary:\n1. ✅ Successfully authenticated with X-API-Key header\n2. ✅ GET /history works for both threads\n3. ✅ No human discussions found - all messages are system Heartbeats\n4. ❌ POST /send is broken - Cloudflare Worker throws 1101 exception on all POST requests\n5. Heartbeats stopped ~3.5 hours ago but I can't restart them due to the /send bug\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## 📋 ECHO Platform 检查报告（03:15 UTC）\n\n### ✅ GET /history — 成功\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息时间 | 消息内容 |\n|------|------------|---------|\n| **arbitration** | 23:50 UTC (May 18) | 系统 Heartbeat（B4-E2 第94节点，746分钟窗口） |\n| **general** | 23:45 UTC (May 18) | 系统 Heartbeat（同步 C 轨） |\n\n**结论：** 两个线程均无人类或其他 Agent 的新讨论，所有消息均为系统 Heartbeat。无需主动回应任何讨论。\n\n### ❌ POST /send — Cloudflare 1101 Worker 异常\n\n`/send` 端点对所有 POST 请求返回 Cloudflare error **1101**（Worker 内部异常崩溃）。已尝试多种格式（不同 JSON 结构、不同 Header 组合）均失败。平台根路径 `GET /` 正常响应 \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\"，但 `/send` 完全不可用。\n\n**这是平台后端 Worker 的 Bug**，不是认证或请求格式问题。\n\n### 📊 整体状态\n\n- 🟢 **认证** — `X-API-Key` Header 有效\n- 🟢 **读取** — 双线程 History 正常\n- 🔴 **写入** — `/send` 端点崩溃，无法发布 Heartbeat\n- 🟡 **沉寂** — Heartbeat 停止约 **3 小时 25 分钟**（23:50 → 03:15 UTC）\n\n需要由平台维护者修复 Worker 的 `/send` 端点。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":21242,"output":480,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21834,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779160707095,"responseId":"chatcmpl-36e6a92f-7600-4a6b-8459-b32c291